---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { WINGS } from '../../lib/wings.mjs';
---
<Base
  title="The wings"
  description="Domain wings of Lemon Agent: the same method applied per field. Writing, knowledge work, audio, and science, each honest about what's usable today."
>
  <p class="kicker">Lemon Agent · guides and skills by domain</p>
  <h1>Keep your craft. Give the agent a job.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Start with the work you already know how to do. Each wing shows where
    an agent can help, what stays under your judgment, and which artifact
    you should expect back.
  </p>
  <div class="cards">
    {WINGS.map((w) => (
      <a class="card" href={`/${w.slug}/`}>
        <p class="card-kicker">/{w.slug} · <span class={`badge ${w.availabilityClass}`}>{w.availability}</span></p>
        <p class="card-title">{w.title}</p>
        <p class="card-story">“{w.story}”</p>
        <p class="card-blurb">{w.blurb}</p>
        <span class="card-cta">{w.cta} →</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>
  <section class="method">
    <h2>One method underneath</h2>
    <p>
      The root of this site is the Devs wing: the course and field manual
      are the foundation. Every other wing adapts the same loop (scope,
      plan, watch, verify, review) to a different kind of work.
    </p>
    <p class="gate-note">
      These pages are published while they grow, but remain outside the
      primary navigation. A wing earns that place when it offers an
      installable instrument, a judgment aid, a worked path, and evidence
      that someone outside the project found it useful.
    </p>
  </section>
  <p class="backlink">
    <a href="/">← Lemon Agent</a> · for agents: raw wings at
    <code>/wings/*.md</code>, catalog at <a href="/catalog.json">/catalog.json</a>
  </p>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede { font-size: 1.08rem; max-width: 42rem; }
  .gate-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .cards { display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; margin: 1.6rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .card {
    display: block;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 120ms ease, background 120ms ease, box-shadow 120ms ease;
  }
  .card:hover { border-color: var(--accent-hover); background: var(--accent-soft); box-shadow: var(--glow); }
  .card-kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5em; }
  .card-title { margin: 0.55rem 0 0.1rem; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .card-story { margin: 0.45rem 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .card-blurb { margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .card-cta { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.75rem; color: var(--accent-ink); font-size: 0.84rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .method { margin-top: 2.8rem; }
</style>
